%% Acquire-Credential API
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Attester
    participant CAI as CAI Implementation
    participant PL as Platform Plug-In
    participant CAS as CAS via<br/>CAAPI

    A->>CAI: Acquire-Credential<br/>(Target, Credential Type, Credenital Hint)
    note over CAI, CAS: Credential Acquisition Initiation Flow
    CAI->>CAS: Initiate-Credential-Acquisition<br/>(Target, Credential Type)
    CAS->>CAS: Invoke the CAS Server
    alt Invalid Credential Type or other Error Condition
        CAS-->>A: Error: Invalid Credential Type,<br/>Invalid Target,<br/>Unavailable Server, etc.
    else Success
        CAS-->>CAI: CAAPI Context:<br/>[Credential Acquisition Mode,<br/>Freshness Kind, Freshness Handle,<br/>Cipher Suites, etc.]
    end
    alt Credential Acquisition Mode is Enroll
        note over CAI, CAS: Credential Enrollment Flow
        CAI->>PL: Generate Asymmetric Credential Signing Key CSK
        PL-->>CAI: Generated CSKpub, CSKpri
        CAI->>CAI: Generate CSR using CSKpri
        note over CAI, PL: Evidence can contain CSR<br/>or vice versa: CSR can contain Evidence<br/>How this is decided is TBD
        CAI->>PL: Generate Evidence<br/>(CSKpub, CSR, Freshness Handle, Credential Hint)
        PL-->>CAI: Generated Evidence
        CAI->>CAS: Enroll-Credential<br/>(Evidence incl., CSKpub, CSR, Credential Hint)
        CAS->>CAS: Invoke the CAS Server's<br/>Enroll() function
        CAS-->>CAI: Enrolled (newly minted) Credential
    else Credential Acquisition Mode is Retrieve
        note over CAI, CAS: Credential Retrieval Flow
        CAI->>PL: Generate Asymmetric Credential Encryption Key CEK
        PL-->>CAI: Generated CEKpub, CEKpri
        CAI->>PL: Generate Evidence<br/>(CEKpub, Freshness Handle, Credential Hint)
        PL-->>CAI: Generated Evidence
        CAI->>CAS: Retrieve-Credential<br/>(Evidence incl. CEKpub, Credential Hint)
        CAS->>CAS: Invoke the CAS Server's<br/>Retrieve() function
        CAS-->>CAI: Retrieved (pre-existing) Credential<br/>encrypted to CEKpub
        CAI-->>CAI: Unwrap the returned credential<br/>using CEKpri
    end
    CAI-->>A: Credential

